# #1434 uncaught: hot_sb's thunk calls sandbox_run natively (60 calls pass the
# JIT entry threshold). On the last call the chunk stamps line 77 and
# error-halts (sandbox_run swallows the error), then sqrt raises in hot_sb's
# own expression on line 9. Pre-fix: "Error line 77: sqrt: ..." and
# "at hot_sb (line 77)". LINE-NUMBER SENSITIVE ([0g] greps these numbers).
ok77 is [1, [68,77,0,0,0, 3, 40], []]
halt77 is [1, [68,77,0,0,0, 3, 2, 7, 40], []]
define hot_sb(d, k) as:
    r is sqrt of (k - (len of (sandbox_run of [d, 100])))
    return r
k is 60
loop while k > 1:
    w is hot_sb of [ok77, k]
    k is k - 1
w is hot_sb of [halt77, 1]
